    /**
     * A rule: its id, its tier, what must be true, why, and how to fix a failure. SUITE-RULES.md has
     * the rest. Its tier says how it is held: "hard" and "story" fail SuiteRulesTest (a story rule
     * only for stories), "advisory" is a warning in the run's output and target/rules-report.md.
     */
    public record Rule(String id, String tier, String name, String why, String fix) {
        public boolean fails() {
            return !tier.equals("advisory");
        }
    }

